      "lag": "4-6 months (company's own figure)",
      "pricing_power": "Does not hedge commodity prices (10-K); offsets through central procurement, substitution and less material per tire. Sold the chemical business (synthetic rubber plants) on 31 October 2025 and now buys that too",
      "note": "Buys all its natural rubber on the world market (10-K)."
    },
